# Seal the chamber and stop every pump
# Closes the gate valve and turns the turbo pump off, then gives it 30 minutes to spin
# down, the vacuum pump still backing it through the foreline. Its speed is not read,
# so the 30 minutes is a time, not a check: confirm it against the turbo pump's manual
# at the bench. Then closes the foreline and vacuum valves and stops the vacuum pump.
# Put it after highvac and before vent.
block seal chamber
load rLACO

hvc gate close
hvc turbo off
until TurboPump = false within 1 min
hold 30 min
hvc foreline close
hvc stop
